  "title": "Israeli Airstrike Kills Seven Aid Workers in Gaza: A Military Tactics Analysis",
  "summary": "The Israeli army's 2024 aid convoy strike in Gaza resulted in the deaths of seven international aid workers, including World Central Kitchen (WCK) personnel. The attack, attributed to a military tactic of establishing guilt by association, led to targeted killings of humanitarian workers and resulted in widespread international outrage.",
  "facts": [
