      "statement": "Seven international aid workers were killed in an airstrike in Gaza in 2024.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The attack targeted three specifically marked World Central Kitchen (WCK) convoys, with other humanitarian workers and local contractors involved.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The Israeli military claimed the attack was part of a broader strategy to establish guilt by association.",
      "confidence": 0.95
